Usage: grid brain search <words> [--task <task>] [flags]
<task> is an id, exact folder name, or folder path inside a project tasks directory.
  -json
    	print JSON
  -level string
    	home or project
  -limit int
    	maximum hits (1 to 100) (default 5)
  -project string
    	project name or id
  -task string
    	resolve this task
  -topic string
    	topic filter
